            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Failure? (अपयश, apayaś.) Experience? (अनुभव, anubhav.) A choice? (निवड, nivaḍ.) A decision? (निर्णय, nirṇay.) A possibility? (शक्यता, śakyatā.) An application? (अर्ज, arj.) An envelope; a wallet? (पाकीट, pākīṭ.) An address? (पत्ता, pattā.) A salary? (पगार, pagār.) A guide? (मार्गदर्शक, mārgadarśak.) A fountain? (कारंजे, kārañje.) A gate? (फाटक, phāṭak.) A fence? (कुंपण, kumpaṇ.) A cellar? (तळघर, taḷghar.) A loft? (माळा, māḷā.)"
            }
